  <name>PoE Recorder (Development)</name>
  <summary>Automatically record and review Path of Exile map runs</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      PoE Recorder records each Path of Exile 2 map run from the game's
      Client.txt log and keeps a local library of videos with the map, area
      level, deaths and trips out of the map.
    </p>
    <p>This development build is for testing unreleased changes.</p>
  </description>
